  "privacidad": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Privacy policy · Huellas</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"How Huellas, a veterinary clinic, handles the data from the appointment form.\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"img/favicon.svg\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header>\n    <a href=\"index.html\">← Back to the site</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>\n\n    <h2>Who keeps your data</h2>\n    <p>Huellas (12 Calle de los Almendros, 28013 Madrid · <a href=\"mailto:hola@huellas.example\">hola@huellas.example</a>) is responsible for the data you give us in the appointment form.</p>\n\n    <h2>What we use them for</h2>\n    <p>Only to manage your appointment and let you know of any changes. We don't use them for advertising or share them with anyone, unless the law obliges us to.</p>\n\n    <h2>How long we keep them</h2>\n    <p>For as long as you are a client of the clinic, and afterward, for as long as the law requires.</p>\n\n    <h2>Your rights</h2>\n    <p>You can ask us to see, correct, or delete your data, or limit its use, by writing to <a href=\"mailto:hola@huellas.example\">hola@huellas.example</a>. If you think we are not handling them well, you can file a complaint with the <a href=\"https://www.aepd.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Spanish Data Protection Agency</a>.</p>\n\n    <h2>On this site</h2>\n    <p>The appointments you book are saved only in your browser: they are not sent to any server. You can delete them by canceling them or by clearing your browser data.</p>\n\n    <p><em>Example text for the course: Huellas is a fictional clinic.</em></p>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer>\n    <p>© 2026 Huellas · Veterinary clinic</p>\n  </footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
